---
import SubpageLayout from '../../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
---

<SubpageLayout title="Citizenship & Identity" description="Identity, registration and citizen-facing services." sectionEmoji="🛠️" sectionLabel="Citizen & Visitor Services" includeTopBar={true} includeFooter={true}>
  <p>Use this page when you need a citizen record, identity confirmation or help understanding who handles a request.</p>

  <h2>Checklist</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Confirm the office you need before visiting</li>
    <li>Bring any identity documents you already have</li>
    <li>Keep copies of forms and correspondence</li>
    <li>Verify office hours before traveling to Yaren</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What it covers</h2>
  <p>Citizenship records, identification questions, registration support and referrals to the right government office.</p>
<h2>What to prepare</h2>
  <p>If you are asking about a document or registration matter, bring names, dates, older paperwork and a clear description of the issue.</p>
<h2>How to proceed</h2>
  <p>Start with the Government Information Office, then follow the referral to the responsible department if a specialist review is needed.</p>

  <h2>Next steps</h2>
  <div class="utility-grid">
    <a href="/directory/">Directory →</a>
    <a href="/contact/">Contact →</a>
    <a href="/services/immigration/">Immigration & Entry →</a>
    <a href="/news/">Latest updates →</a>
  </div>
</SubpageLayout>

<style>
  .utility-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;margin:1rem 0 2rem}
  .utility-grid a{border:2px solid #1a1a2e;background:#fff;padding:16px;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 #1a1a2e;font-weight:700;display:block}
  @media (max-width: 720px){.utility-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
